1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,244
Every room at this Cancun resort has its own private hot tub.

2
00:00:04,294 --> 00:00:09,346
That is all one thousand three hundred thirty-four rooms at Moon Palace Cancun.

3
00:00:09,396 --> 00:00:12,440
Soak in your room, then walk to a white sand beach.

4
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:16,829
Add seven pools, three swim-up bars, and a free beach club.

5
00:00:16,879 --> 00:00:21,212
Sixteen restaurants, with breakfast included and room service all night.

6
00:00:21,261 --> 00:00:24,250
Want a spa day? There is a hydrotherapy circuit too.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,991
Play golf at the Moon Palace Golf Club, a short walk away.

8
00:00:28,041 --> 00:00:30,102
And there are five pickleball courts.

9
00:00:30,153 --> 00:00:34,205
The full tour is on my channel.
